# The loops kept over LBA2's screens in play (fixtures/loopssa: the
# sweep's save of scene 54 and soundout's lba.cfg with SaveAnywhere: ON).
# The protopack, actor 2, flies its route with its hum looping. Escape
# opens LBA2's main menu over the game and Resume Game goes back, S opens
# the list to save into and Escape leaves it, and L opens the list to
# load from and Escape leaves it, one after the other while the hum
# plays, some 21 seconds after the load, the screens holding the clock.
# In the 1994 code the first screen stops the hum for good. Set aside and
# played on after each screen, it hums until the protopack lands.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 3
shot start
sleep 12.5
shot flight
key Escape
sleep 1.5
shot menu2
key Return
sleep 1
key s
sleep 1.5
shot save
key Escape
sleep 1
key l
sleep 1.5
shot load
key Escape
sleep 1.5
shot after
sleep 6
shot end
